{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08947","headline":"拟古诗十二首 三 · 韦应物","name":"拟古诗十二首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峨峨高山巅，浼浼青川流。\n世人不自悟，驰谢如惊飍。\n百金非所重，厚意良难得。\n旨酒亲与朋，芳年乐京国。\n京城繁华地，轩盖凌晨出。\n垂杨十二衢，隐暎金张室。\n汉宫南北对，飞观齐白日。\n游泳属芳时，平生自云毕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}